&lt;div class=&quot;image-container aligncenter&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/sushiblade-hub/%E6%81%8B%E6%98%8F%E5%B4%8E%E5%BA%97%E5%BA%97%E4%B8%BBwith%E3%83%A9%E3%82%A4%E3%83%95%E3%83%AB/medium.jpg&quot; width=&quot;300px&quot; alt=&quot;medium.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;光臨！！！歡迎來到闇壽司戀昏崎店！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oh！客人你對闇壽司有興趣嗎？&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
