					<item>
				<guid>http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what</guid>
				<title>Calibri的超酷艺作页（大部分只是图标，但无论如何，它超酷）</title>
				<link>http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what</link>
				<description>


&lt;p&gt;哈喽，欢迎来到我的艺作页！ 这里是我发布我所创作的艺术作品的地方，比方说ACS图标还有徽标啥的。不要犹豫，留下来享受吧！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;又：如果你需要徽章，图标，或者其他类似的东西，我会在wiki和聊天室等着你的私信的！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;ACS图标&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;ACS图标&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这儿是我为机密分级而做的ACS图标！很明显，其中大部分都不会被采用，但无论如何，制作起来都很有趣！你能在&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/esoteric-classes-complete-list&quot;&gt;这里&lt;/a&gt;找到它们的意思。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icons&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_image color-white&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/Decommissioned%20Icon&quot; alt=&quot;Decommissioned%20Icon&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_name&quot;&gt;decommissioned&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_image color-white&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/Yesod%20Icon&quot; alt=&quot;Yesod%20Icon&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_name&quot;&gt;yesod&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_image color-white&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/Maksur%20Icon&quot; alt=&quot;Maksur%20Icon&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_name&quot;&gt;maksur&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_image color-white&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/Ignosi%20Icon&quot; alt=&quot;Ignosi%20Icon&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_name&quot;&gt;ignosi&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_image color-white&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://usercontent.irccloud-cdn.com/file/kNm1WIHD/Screen%20Shot%202019-12-28%20at%201.31.21%20PM.png&quot; alt=&quot;Screen%20Shot%202019-12-28%20at%201.31.21%20PM.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;icon_name&quot;&gt;drygioni&lt;/div&gt;
