					<![CDATA[
						 <p>哈喽，欢迎来到我的艺作页！ 这里是我发布我所创作的艺术作品的地方，比方说ACS图标还有徽标啥的。不要犹豫，留下来享受吧！</p> <p>又：如果你需要徽章，图标，或者其他类似的东西，我会在wiki和聊天室等着你的私信的！</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;ACS图标</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;ACS图标</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>这儿是我为机密分级而做的ACS图标！很明显，其中大部分都不会被采用，但无论如何，制作起来都很有趣！你能在<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/esoteric-classes-complete-list">这里</a>找到它们的意思。</p> <div class="icons"> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-white"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/Decommissioned%20Icon" alt="Decommissioned%20Icon" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">decommissioned</div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-white"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/Yesod%20Icon" alt="Yesod%20Icon" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">yesod</div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-white"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/Maksur%20Icon" alt="Maksur%20Icon" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">maksur</div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-white"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/Ignosi%20Icon" alt="Ignosi%20Icon" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">ignosi</div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-white"><img src="https://usercontent.irccloud-cdn.com/file/kNm1WIHD/Screen%20Shot%202019-12-28%20at%201.31.21%20PM.png" alt="Screen%20Shot%202019-12-28%20at%201.31