mg src="https://usercontent.irccloud-cdn.com/file/w200/frvmXr8c" alt="frvmXr8c" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">Girouette</div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-white"><img src="https://usercontent.irccloud-cdn.com/file/JOk0B4RA/Kusum.png" alt="Kusum.png" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">kušum</div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-six"><img src="https://usercontent.irccloud-cdn.com/file/duL9smLc/Whatever%20It's%20Called.png" alt="Whatever%20It's%20Called.png" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">tipler-barrow<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-130217-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup></div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-six"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/Nehemoth" alt="Nehemoth" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">nehemoth</div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-six"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/Axolotl" alt="Axolotl" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">axolotl<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-130217-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup></div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-six"><img src="https://usercontent.irccloud-cdn.com/file/sC8F8Shu/Gladstone.png" alt="Gladstone.png" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">gladstone<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-130217-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >3</a></sup></div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-six"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/G%C3%B6del" alt="Gödel" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">gödel</div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-six"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/Gevurah" alt="Gevurah" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">gevurah</div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-six"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/Juggernaut" alt="Juggernaut" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">juggernaut</div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-six"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/Hera" alt="Hera" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">hera</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;“骑手们”徽章</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;“骑手们”徽章</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>没错，这是<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/chapter-one-the-end">骑手们</a>的官方徽章！</p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://kontainer.djkakt.us/local--files/calibri-bold-s-mega-cool-minecraft-server/Riders" alt="Riders" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;“占星师行动”徽标</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;“占星师行动”徽标</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1425">占星师行动</a>的饭制徽标。</p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="https://usercontent.irccloud-cdn.com/file/w300/vDXY0qz9" alt="vDXY0qz9" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;“钻石剑”徽章</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;“钻石剑”徽章</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>徽章属于我即将到来的机动特遣队，MTF Chi-64（“钻石剑”）！</p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="https://usercontent.irccloud-cdn.com/file/w200/JSg5lPKs" alt="JSg5lPKs" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;“URA文档”图标</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;“URA文档”图标</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2235">URA文档</a>的饭制图标。</p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="https://usercontent.irccloud-cdn.com/file/JpyvSdIE/URA.png" alt="URA.png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;MTF&nbsp;Omega-14徽章</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;MTF&nbsp;Omega-14徽章</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4262">机动特遣队Omega-14（“完美十人组”）</a>的饭制徽章。</p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="https://usercontent.irccloud-cdn.com/file/unBQwWO9/MTF%20Omega-14%20(%22Perfect%2010%22).png" alt="MTF%20Omega-14%20(%22Perfect%2010%22).png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="licensebox"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;授权&nbsp;/&nbsp;引用</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;隐藏授权&nbsp;/&nbsp;引用</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>请按如下方式引用此页：</p> <p>更多详情请参阅<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/licensing-guide">授权指南</a>。<br /> <strong>授权信息</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>名称：</strong>Calibri的超酷艺作页（大部分只是图标，但无论如何，它超酷）<br /> <strong>作者：</strong>Calibri Bold<br /> <strong>授权协议：</strong>CC-by-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>备注：</strong>此属性适用于本页所有图片。</p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/joke3579" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4915133&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970909" alt="joke3579" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4915133)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/joke3579" >joke3579</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">脚注</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-130217-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. 由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nameless-mediocre" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4176498&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970909" alt="Nameless Mediocre" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4176498)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nameless-mediocre" >Nameless Mediocre</a></span>创作；项目兼为该宇宙内具有智能的观察者的因与果。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-130217-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. 由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xilascrowe" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2969291&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970909" alt="XilasCrowe" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2969291)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xilascrowe" >XilasCrowe</a></span>创作；我不知道这东西是干啥用的，我只知道Xilas想用它完成自己的邪恶目的。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-130217-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. 由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2902864&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970909" alt="MaliceAforethought" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2902864)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought" >MaliceAforethought</a></span>创作；项目目前由英国政府管辖，而不是基金会。</div> </div> 
				 	]]>
