class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> <div class="creditBottomRate" style="position:relative;height:30px;"> <div style="text-align: center; top: 0px;"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="background: url(http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/the-great-hippo/scp_trans.png) center no-repeat ; float: center; border: solid 2px #000000; padding: 1px 15px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>检测到人员登录</span></h2> <p><span style="color: #ff5c48"><span style="font-size:150%;">请对准麦克风说出以下口令以进行语音验证</span></span></p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:larger;">The Past is Never Dead</span></p> </div> </div> <br /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>╟ Under cloud beneath the stars ╣</p> <p><span style="color: #4c4c4c">╟ Over snow and winter's morn ╣</span></p> <p><span style="color: #666666">╟ I turn at last to paths that lead home ╣</span></p> <p><span style="color: #7f7f7f">╟ And oh where the road then takes me ╣</span></p> <p><span style="color: #b2b2b2">╟ I can not tell ╣</span></p> <p><span style="color: #cccccc">╟ We came all this way ╣</span></p> <p><span style="color: #e5e5e5">╟ But now comes the day ╣</span></p> <p><span style="color: #efefef">╟ To bid you farewell ╣</span></p> </div> <br /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:130%;">权限确认。晚上好，Wisperlestrade Albert。</span><br /> <br /> <span style="font-size:130%;">调取人员档案：Sirius</span><br /> <br /> <span style="font-size:130%;">警告：部分信息损￥#@玖!#簜&gt;?*&quot;9$@#</span></p> </div> <br /> <div id="wiki-tabview-bd7d495afc91092a908478e60501635d" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>员工简介</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>原创作品</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>翻译</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>推歌时间！</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>成就章</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>留言版（嘶，真出戏）</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragment:scp-4182-1/blank.png" style="width:300px;" alt="blank.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p><strong>{无效文件/名录}</strong></p> </div> </div> <p><strong>姓名：</strong>Dr.Sirius/Rechal Sirius/天狼星<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">屑天狼</span></p> <p><strong>性别：</strong>男</p> <p><strong>安保权限等级：</strong>4级</p> <p><strong>任职站点：</strong>Site-CN-82-β</p> <p><strong>个人信息：</strong>体型较为瘦削，黑发黑眸，黑色方框眼镜，穿着一件白大褂，总会有一只耳朵挂着耳机。大多数时间温和热情，但有时候会死死盯着员工，还会开一些恶劣的玩笑，导致员工难以与其相处。身体状况因不明原因停留在30岁。</p> <p>体能一般，偏爱冷兵器，但自从上任以来几乎没有用到过的时候，身边的收容失效也很少。有观点认为Dr.Sirius是一个现实槽，但无可靠证据。</p> <p>因为目睹了<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/a-report-on-evertworth">Chris Evertworth</a>的死亡,情绪变得不稳定，不建议其接触与精神影响有关的项目。</p> <p><strong>专长：</strong>生物，认知危害，逆模因</p> <p><strong>爱好：</strong>听歌，看风景</p> <p><strong>厌恶：</strong>无特别厌恶</p> <p><strong>工作记录：</strong><br /> [资料损毁]</p> <p>[资料损毁]</p> <p>于1940年进入Site-CN-64。</p> <p>1945年转入Site-CN-82-β工作，获取3级权限，并与Chris Evertworth相识.</p> <p>1970年因Dr.maybe推荐晋升Site-CN-82-β主管。</p> <p>2001/1/1，被发现昏迷于Site-CN-82-β的DNA序列保存室，后发现其记忆遭到了大规模F级记忆改写。原有记忆内容不得而知。</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1495">SCP-CN-1495</a>——青冢月</span><br /> 船沉了，人却还没有消散。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1744">SCP-CN-1744</a>——注定的灭亡</span><br /> 拿走的，迟早要还回来。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1745">SCP-CN-1745</a>——水银瞳</span><br /> 愿我天朝盛世无疆，愿我河山永固安康。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1746">SCP-CN-1746</a>——代号：希望之花</span><br /> 有时候，忘记也是一种幸福。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1983">SCP-CN-1983</a>——向那遥远的天穹</span><br /> 2019/9/20，SCP-CN-1983试图飞往外层空间，在途中无效化。</p> <hr /> <h3><span>系列作品：《圣战》</span></h3> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>序章<br /> <span style="font-size:120%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1916">SCP-CN-1916</a>——大龙啊，顺从死亡</span></p> <p><iframe frameborder="no" border="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" width="330" height="52" src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com//music.163.com/outchain/player?type=2&id=1356379086&auto=0&height=32"></iframe><br /> 第一幕<br /> <span style="font-size:120%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1425">SCP-CN-1425</a>——终末幻想机械赞歌</span></p> <p><iframe frameborder="no" border="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" width="330" height="52" src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com//music.163.com/outchain/player?type=2&id=511181532&auto=0&height=32"></iframe></p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2171">SCP-2171</a>——秋天的牧羊人</span><br /> 想象一下，你要把一个大陆和其他大陆分开，让它们在云海上滑行。</p> <hr /></div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:110%;"><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=29755223">♫The Last Goodbye♫</a></span></p> <p><span style="font-size:110%;"><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=28048693">♫I See Fire♫</a></span></p> <p><span style="font-size:110%;"><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=1427943">♫Into the West♫</a></span></p> <p><span style="font-size:110%;"><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=21809235">♫So Says I♫</a></span></p> <p><span style="font-size:110%;"><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=3986241">♫Yesterday Once More♫</a></span></p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%A1%A8%E6%98%8E.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%A1%A8%E6%98%8E.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>加入证明</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>被批准加入网站</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%AF%E3%81%98%E3%82%81%E3%81%BE%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6%E3%81%AE%E6%8C%A8%E6%8B%B6.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%AF%E3%81%98%E3%82%81%E3%81%BE%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6%E3%81%AE%E6%8C%A8%E6%8B%B6.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>初次见面</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在讨论区发言</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E3%81%AE%E5%AE%9F%E9%A8%93%E5%AE%A4.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E3%81%AE%E5%AE%9F%E9%A8%93%E5%AE%A4.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>千仞高塔，卡崩于此</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在沙盒中废弃3个及以上页面</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%84%E3%82%8C%E3%81%B0.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%84%E3%82%8C%E3%81%B0.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>逆模因发帖</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在讨论区发布草稿，然后沉帖</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%B0%8F%E3%81%95%E3%81%AA%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A9.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%B0%8F%E3%81%95%E3%81%AA%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A9.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>一小步</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇文档</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E6%8E%A1%E7%94%A8%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E6%8E%A1%E7%94%A8%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>录取通知</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>创建人事档案</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%8A%85%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%8A%85%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>铜奖章</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分15以上的文档</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%8A%E7%A5%AD%E3%82%8A%E5%A5%BD%E3%81%8D.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%8A%E7%A5%AD%E3%82%8A%E5%A5%BD%E3%81%8D.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>喜欢祭典</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>参加一次竞赛</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%8C%BB%E8%80%85.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%8C%BB%E8%80%85.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>医学家</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、包含下列任一标签的SCP文档：医学性、生理性、眼睛、骨骼、毒性</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%BB%BA%E7%AF%89%E5%AE%B6.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%BB%BA%E7%AF%89%E5%AE%B6.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>建筑学家</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、包含下列任一标签的SCP文档：城市、建筑家、地点</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E6%97%85%E4%BA%BA.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E6%97%85%E4%BA%BA.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>旅行家</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、包含下列任一标签的SCP文档：时空、未来、超维度、地图、门径</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%B4%A9%E5%A3%8A%E3%81%AE%E3%81%8D%E3%81%A3%E3%81%8B%E3%81%91.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%B4%A9%E5%A3%8A%E3%81%AE%E3%81%8D%E3%81%A3%E3%81%8B%E3%81%91.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>崩坏的契机</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上、包含K级情景标签的SCP文档</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3%E3%83%BB%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E3%83%BB%E3%83%96%E3%83%A9%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3%E3%83%BB%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E3%83%BB%E3%83%96%E3%83%A9%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>另一个你</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>连续5次被自己解除编辑锁定</strong></span></p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-5" style="display:none"> <blockquote> <p>所以终于咕……啊不是，肝出来了，大家好吖（#^·^#）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirius-dawn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5934437&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970910" alt="Sirius Dawn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5934437)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirius-dawn" >Sirius Dawn</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>被催了无数次才发人事的天狼是屑啦<span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><em>西北望，射天狼</em></span> ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/diamond-apple" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5190582&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970910" alt="Diamond_Apple" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5190582)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/diamond-apple" >Diamond_Apple</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>西北望，射天狼！（高声尖叫）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-evertworth" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6285604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970910" alt="Chris Evertworth" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6285604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-evertworth" >Chris Evertworth</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>天狼星？那么也可以指路咯！！！（瞻仰））——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/krampus-of-error" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6050311&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970910" alt="Krampus of Error" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6050311)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/krampus-of-error" >Krampus of Error</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>来打酱油——顺便祝贺天狼星喜提人事——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mo-ring" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3606007&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970910" alt="Mo-ring" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3606007)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mo-ring" >Mo-ring</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>别人的作者页.html——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrpasserby" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5150580&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970910" alt="MrPasserby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5150580)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrpasserby" >MrPasserby</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>跳段街舞 ጿ ኈ ቼ ዽ ጿ ኈ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rorrerd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3453246&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970910" alt="rorrErD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3453246)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rorrerd" >rorrErD</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>迟到的祝贺，恭喜！<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swred" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5992128&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970910" alt="Swred" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5992128)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swred" >Swred</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>贴贴天狼前辈www——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6062512&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970910" alt="YUANNN" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6062512)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn" >YUANNN</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>到此一游~ <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>&lt;。<span class="ruby">+++++<span class="rt"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">/////////</span></span></span>《——<span class="error-inline"><em>LonelyFishbone</em> 不匹配任何一个现有的用户名</span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>天狼星发电站又双叒叕被我炸了，不过我删稿快，阻止了危机，你得好好感谢我（doge）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maybe-abs" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5540157&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970910" alt="Maybe-ABS" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5540157)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maybe-abs" >Maybe-ABS</a></span></p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <div class="pseudo-tags"> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85#pages">作者</a></li> <li>夜空中最亮的星</li> <li>黄袍的国丈</li> <li>北风的狼王</li> <li>西北望，射天狼</li> <li>挽长弓兮射天狼</li> <li>必须诛国贼，先要射天狼</li> <li>只识弯弓射天狼</li> <li>流星一条射天狼</li> </ul> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirius-dawn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5934437&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970910" alt="Sirius Dawn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5934437)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirius-dawn" >Sirius Dawn</a></span></p> 
