					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="display:none"><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/nav%3Aside/styleFrame.html?bhl" name="typeFrame"></iframe></div> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/memoria-adytum/memoriabanner.jpg" alt="memoriabanner.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <span style="font-family: 'Long Cang', cursive; color: #390000;font-size: 450%;"><strong>追忆，内殿</strong></span></div> <div class="type1"> <p><sup>5</sup>……亚恩站在燃烧的废墟中，这片废墟曾是通往基西拉之城的大门。再一次伪装成一个人类，在以他的名义造成的灾难面前屈卑。他环顾四周，看到了那些他曾经希望获得自由的人们所遭受的痛苦，意识到他们的伟大杰作是经由他的手埋没。<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> 他看着他们，泪流不止。<br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="font-family:var(--body-font); font-size: calc(var(--base-font-size) * 1.00); color: #000000;">- <em>堕落之书，13:5；所罗门尼派</em>《Valkzaron》</span></p> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">╡<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sarkicism-hub">欲肉教中心页</a>╞</span></p> </div> <h3><span>前言：<span style="font-family: 'Long Cang', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 120%"><em>太初有道</em></span></span></h3> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">基金会威胁意识：<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[&#32;|&#32;|&#32;|&#32;|&#32;]</span></span></p> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2095">SCP-2095：伊亚罗斯之围</a> <em>by Metaphysician</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2480">SCP-2480：未完的仪式</a> <em>by Metaphysician</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/mother-who-demands-ones-toes">术士Halyna Ieva，又称索取他人脚趾的母亲</a> <em>by naepicfael &amp; TheMightyMcB</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/lovataar-throne">拉娃塔与御座</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <hr /> <h3><span>第一部分：<span style="font-family: 'Long Cang', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 120%"><em>苍马入目</em></span></span></h3> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">基金会威胁意识：<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[</span><span style="color: #390000">█</span> | | | <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]</span></span></p> <h5><span><em>正典</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">主线</span></span></h5> <ul> <li>瘟疫 - <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3862">SCP-3862: The Gentleman Karcist</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> <li>战争 - <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/another-soul-joins-the-halkost">Another Soul Joins the Halkost</a> <em>by TheMightyMcB</em></li> <li>饥荒 - <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4786">SCP-4786：饥饿之口</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> <li>死亡 - <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/anthropological-report-darkwater">Case Study 03: The Darkwater Lodge</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <ul> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/et-ecce">Et Ecce Equus Pallidus</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <h5><span><em>辅助</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">补充故事</span></span></h5> <ul> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4476">SCP-4476: La Famille Natau</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2408">SCP-2408：欧若科之陨</a> <em>by Metaphysician</em></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4197">SCP-4197: Hollow</a> <em>by Dyslexion</em></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/lance-and-bernard-s-culinary-capers">Lance and Bernard's Culinary Capers</a> <em>by Dyslexion</em></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/mornings-mornings-are-sometimes-like-that">mornings Mornings Are Sometimes Like That</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <h5><span><em>终末</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">最后一幕</span></span></h5> <ul> <li>此世皇帝 - <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3911">SCP-3911: The Thorn of God</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <hr /> <h3><span>第二部分：<span style="font-family: 'Long Cang', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 120%;"><em>他们凯旋</em></span></span></h3> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">基金会威胁意识：<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[</span><span style="color: #390000">██</span> | | <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]</span></span></p> <h5><span><em>正典</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">主线</span></span></h5> <ul> <li>瘟疫 - <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5862">SCP-5862: Faulkner's Wake</a> <em>by MalyceGraves &amp; cybersqyd</em></li> </ul> <h5><span><em>辅助</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">补充故事</span></span></h5> <ul> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5207">SCP-5207: Fit for the King</a> <em>by MalyceGraves &amp; DrAkimoto</em></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5407">SCP-5407: &quot;нектар&quot;</a> <em>by DrAkimoto</em></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/regarding-scp-5862">Re: 5862 (Supplemental)</a> <em>by MalyceGraves &amp; cybersqyd</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/kelipat">Kelipat Nogah</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5038">SCP-5038: La Rue Macabre is CLOSED</a> <em>by MalyceGraves and plaidypus</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/unbearable-hope">Unbearable Hope</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <h5><span><em>终末</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">最后一幕</span></span></h5> <hr /> <h3><span>第三部分：<span style="font-family: 'Long Cang', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 120%;"><em>征服世界</em></span></span></h3> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">基金会威胁意识：<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[</span><span style="color: #390000">███</span> | <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]</span></span></p> <h5><span><em>正典</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">主线</span></span></h5> <h5><span><em>辅助</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">补充故事</span></span></h5> <h5><span><em>终末</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">最后一幕</span></span></h5> <hr /> <h3><span>第四部分：<span style="font-family: 'Long Cang', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 120%;"><em>焚世净火</em></span></span></h3> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">基金会威胁意识：<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[</span><span style="color: #390000">█████</span><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]</span></span></p> <hr /> <div class="authors"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;作者归属</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;隐藏作者归属</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p>当前作者：</p> <ol> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4916887&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970911" alt="MalyceGraves" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4916887)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" >MalyceGraves</a></span> - {<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/malycegraves-author">作者页</a>}</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5255688&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970911" alt="DrAkimoto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5255688)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" >DrAkimoto</a></span> - {<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/drakimoto-s-author-page">作者页</a>}</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themightymcb" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4483018&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970911" alt="TheMightyMcB" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4483018)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themightymcb" >TheMightyMcB</a></span> - {<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/themightymcb-s-author-page">作者页</a>}</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/n-aepic-fael" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4463776&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970911" alt="N_Aepic_Fael" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4463776)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/n-aepic-fael" >N_Aepic_Fael</a></span> - {<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/he-who-cannot-stop-stealing">作者页</a>}</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dyslexion" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5549954&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970911" alt="Dyslexion" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5549954)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dyslexion" >Dyslexion</a></span> - {<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/dyslexion-author-page">作者页</a>}</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5336470&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970911" alt="cybersqyd" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5336470)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" >cybersqyd</a></span> - {<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/cybersqyd">作者页</a>}</li> </ol> <p>如果没有<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/metaphysician" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1698079&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608970911" alt="Metaphysician" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1698079)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/metaphysician" >Metaphysician</a></span>的出色工作，这一切都不可能实现 - {<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/metaphysician">作者页</a>}</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="licensebox"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;授权&nbsp;/&nbsp;引用</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;隐藏授权&nbsp;/&nbsp;引用</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>请按如下方式引用此页：</p> <p>更多详情请参阅<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/licensing-guide">授权指南</a>。<br /> <strong>授权信息</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>来源：</strong><a href="https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/items/3a0eb990-c610-012f-5af3-58d385a7bc34#/?uuid=510d47dc-88be-a3d9-e040-e00a18064a99">NYPL</a><br /> <strong>许可：</strong>CC 1.0 PD<br /> <strong>标题：</strong><em>Allá vá eso</em><br /> <strong>作者：</strong>Francisco Goya<br /> <strong>发布年份：</strong>无说明，在2015年数字化</p> <p><strong>来源：</strong><a href="https://www.rijksmuseum.nl/en/collection/RP-P-1961-454">Rijks Museum</a><br /> <strong>许可：</strong>CC 1.0 PD<br /> <strong>标题：</strong><em>Dwaasheid van de angst</em>, Francisco de Goya, 1815 - 1820<br /> <strong>作者：</strong>Francisco Goya<br /> <strong>发布年份：</strong>1815 - 1820 和/或 1864</p> <p><strong>来源：</strong><a href="https://www.metmuseum.org/art/collection/search/333838">The Met</a><br /> <strong>许可：</strong>CC 1.0 PD<br /> <strong>标题：</strong>Various plates from <em>The Disasters of War</em> (Los Desastres de la Guerra)<br /> <strong>作者：</strong>Francisco Goya<br /> <strong>发布年份：</strong>1810–20，出版于1863</p> <p><strong>来源：</strong>Above art &amp; <a href="http://http://www.scp-wiki.net/">The SCP-Wiki</a><br /> <strong>许可：</strong>CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>标题：</strong>memoriabanner.jpg<br /> <strong>作者：</strong>Fra